@startuml Donation and Box Intake Process

title Process: receiving a donation and attesting a box
caption Target design. Decisions O22, D14, D5, D6, O16, D1, D21, D7, D25, D2, O17, O29, D35. Plans 04, 05, 06, 16.

|Donor|
start
:Email HQ that goods are coming;

|Dispatcher|
if (Enter it before it arrives?) then (yes)
  :Record donor and donation;
  :Create an expected box with a destination Receiver;
  |Freedom|
  if (Receiver registered?) then (no)
    :Refuse the destination;
    |Dispatcher|
    :Choose a registered Receiver,\nor ask the Administrator to register one;
  else (yes)
  endif
else (no, enter it on arrival)
endif

|Loader|
:Receive the goods at a hub you manage;
:Check in the box and place it in a bay;

repeat
  :Record an item: category, quantity,\nvalue in GBP and its source, expiry, donation;
  |Freedom|
  :Look up the customs codes for the category;
  if (Category not carried?) then (yes)
    :Warn: gas, lithium batteries, flammables;
  elseif (Expired?) then (yes)
    :Warn: the box cannot be attested;
  elseif (Short shelf life?) then (yes)
    :Warn: short remaining shelf life;
  elseif (Sensitive category?) then (yes)
    :Flag: the Dispatcher will be warned;
  else (no)
  endif
  |Loader|
repeat while (More items?) is (yes)
->no;

:Weigh and measure the box;
:Attest the box;

|Freedom|
if (Any expired item?) then (yes)
  :Refuse attestation;
  |Loader|
  :Remove or replace the item;
  stop
else (no)
  :Record the attestation from the login;
  :Contents are now fixed;
endif

|Loader|
:Issue the QR code and print the label;

|Freedom|
:Translate item lines to Ukrainian, offline;
:Label: box number, items and signer,\nin English and Ukrainian, no Receiver or address;
stop

@enduml
